     {
      "text": [
       {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "Open culture.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "At Resilience.Earth we believe in open culture. We share our knowledge through our methodologies, research and tools under free licences so that they can be used and improved by other people and groups under the same conditions as we have done. You will find all our published resources in the \"Disruptive tools\" section; if you have any questions about using the tools, you can contact us at info@resilience.earth",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "title": "Open culture",
      "titleHeading": "h2",
      "alias": "Openness",
      "media": null,
      "styles": null,
      "c2a": {
       "text": "Disruptive tools",
       "href": "https://w.resilience.earth/eines-disruptives",
       "target": null,
       "cssClass": "btn btn-dark btn-dark-border-white btn-100 mt-4 zw-100 btn-with-arrow-right",
       "page": null
      },
      "verticalScroller": null
     },
     {
      "text": [
       {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "The Balanç Social and the MEC.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "url": "https://xes.cat/balanc-social",
          "type": "link",
          "children": [
           {
            "text": "Balanç Social",
            "type": "text"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "text": " (Social Balance) is a tool for accountability and for measuring social, environmental and good-governance impact, promoted by the Solidarity Economy Network (XES), of which Resilience.Earth is a member. With this balance we systematically, objectively and periodically audit and evaluate our economic functioning and profit policy; gender perspective; equity and internal democracy; environmental sustainability; social commitment and cooperation; and quality of work. ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "url": "https://api-w.resilience.earth/uploads/Balanc_social_resilience_earth_2024_849ad8de5a.pdf",
          "type": "link",
          "children": [
           {
            "text": "",
            "type": "text"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "In addition, the Resilience Earth cooperative is committed to internal transparency with its members in all matters affecting the cooperative, by presenting annual general reports, annual financial reports, annual budgets, annual operational plans and the evolving strategic plan. To support this process we have created the Cooperative's Evolutionary Manual, an agile, transparent and coordinated tool for internal work.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "title": "Transparency",
      "titleHeading": "h2",
      "alias": "Transparency",
      "media": 1247,
      "styles": {
       "cssClass": "balanc-social",
       "height": null,
       "textColor": "dark",
       "margin": null,
       "padding": null,
       "background": null,
       "width": null,
       "sectionId": null,
